   "textLength": 453,
   "text": "This guide is for SaaS startups who want to accept recurring payments (subscriptions) using a flat-rate pricing model. This means you charge a flat rate per month for your product or service at the beginning of a certain time period.\nThe payment flow redirects your customers to a Stripe-hosted page to enter their payment details, then returns them to your site. You use Checkout to create the Strip",
