   "text": "Your server communicates with the Stripe API to initialise the checkout process, but Stripe securely hosts the actual payment form. Setting up your server varies by programming language, but typically involves installing the Stripe library, configuring your API keys, and implementing the endpoints needed to create a Checkout Session and handle post-payment processes.",
