   "textLength": 436,
   "text": "Note\nThe checkout.session.completed event tells your integration that the customer completed checkout, but payment can still be pending for delayed-notification payment methods. Before provisioning access, wait for invoice.paid or checkout.session.async_payment_succeeded, and verify the subscription or payment status. These events don’t reset the subscription’s billing period. Learn more about whe",
