  {
   "index": 40,
   "tag": "p×2",
   "landmarks": [
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 670,
   "text": "You can explicitly set a subscription’s billing cycle anchor to a fixed date (for example, the 1st of the next month) when creating a Checkout Session. The billing cycle anchor determines the first full invoice date, when customers are billed the full subscription amount. For example, a monthly subscription created on 15 May with an anchor on 1 June is first initially billed on 15 May, then always",
   "counts": {
