   "textLength": 317,
   "text": "If the billing cycle anchor is during a session’s active period and a customer attempts payment after it has passed, Checkout displays and charges for the full period, starting with the billing cycle anchor instead of the prorated period before the billing cycle anchor.\nTo learn more, see Set the billing cycle date.",
