   "tag": "ul",
   "class": "List default ⚙ as-6t",
   "landmarks": [
    "article"
   ],
   "textLength": 367,
   "text": "Enable and automatically collect tax on subscriptions in a Checkout Session.\nCancel or refund a payment. You can cancel a payment before it’s completed or refund all or part of a payment after it succeeds.\nSet up your bank account to receive payouts.\nEnable Adaptive pricing. This allows Stripe to let your customers pay in their local currency in over 150 countries.",
